{
  "message": "Beta, 180 subscribers in 5 months sounds nice, but 64% renew in month 2 is barely above noise. Aapka CAC kitna hai aur gross margin kya nikal raha hai jab food aur delivery mila ke Rs 103 per meal ja raha hai?",
  "out": false,
