{
  "message": "180 subscribers in 5 months gives roughly 36 new customers per month, so your implied CAC is around ₹1.1 lakh if you spent the full ₹40 lakh on acquisition, which is absurd for a Pune tiffin service. Aapka gross margin barely 15% after food and delivery, aur yeh koi SaaS nahi hai, bas ek thin wrapper hai Swiggy या Zomato ke substitutes par, jisme koi switching cost nahi hai.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 3
}

{
  "message": "180 * 3200 / 100 gives 576000 rupees monthly revenue. Aap bas teen ghar ki rasoi par chal rahe ho with 185 rupees cost per meal; yeh ek thin wrapper hai Dabbawala ka, aur switching cost zero hai kyunki koi bhi competitor Pune IT parks mein easily replace kar sakta hai. I am not convinced this is a company, merely a feature. Maybe.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 4
}

{
  "message": "Pune ke IT parks mein 64% month-2 renew ke saath 180 subscribers, yeh thin wrapper hai jisme switching cost bilkul zero hai; aur aapne Rs 103 per meal cost bataya jabki price Rs 3200 / 22 meals hai toh gross margin sirf 53%, matlab 180 * 103 = 18540 rupees monthly food aur delivery cost, yeh samajh nahi aa raha ki yeh 8% equity ke liye Rs 5 crore valuation kaise justify hota hai. Maybe.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 6
}

{
  "message": "Pune ke IT parks mein 180 subscribers aur 64% renewal ke saath, aapka CAC kabhi recover hoga jab switching cost bilkul zero hai? Yeh thin wrapper kisi bhi Dabbawala se alag nahi lag raha, aur aapke teeno ghar ki rasoi se aage koi on-ground distribution plan nahi dikha. Maybe.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 6
}

{
  "message": "180 subscribers aur 3200 rupees ki monthly fee se 576000 rupees monthly revenue aa raha hai, matlab 180 * 3200 / 100 = 576000. Food aur delivery mila ke 103 rupees cost hai, toh gross margin 2167 rupees per subscriber per month banta hai, par teen ghar ki rasoi pe 180 log handle karna Ludhiana ke spare-parts wholesale jaisa scalable nahi lagta. Jab switching cost zero hai aur Pune IT parks mein koi lock-in nahi, toh 40 lakh rupees ki valuation par profit kab dikhega? Maybe.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 6
}

{
  "message": "Beta, 180 subscribers se monthly revenue 576000 rupees ban raha hai, par cost 103 per meal hai toh gross margin itna kam hai ki payback period kabhi dikhega nahi. Pune IT parks mein 64% renewal aur zero switching cost dekh ke lagta hai yeh sirf ek thin wrapper hai, aur teen ghar ki rasoi se aage scale karne ka koi plan nahi hai. I am not convinced, pass.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

{
  "message": "180 * 22 gives 3960 lunches monthly. Food cost 85 and delivery 18 means 103 per meal. 3200 minus 103 is 3097 margin per subscriber. But yeh 3960 meals ka hisaab mere 576000 revenue se match nahi karta, toh kya aapne 22 lunches ka matlab 22 working days liya hai ya kuch aur? Mujhe yeh clear chahiye before I decide anything.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 6
}

{
  "message": "180 * 3200 gives 576000 rupees monthly revenue, par aapka Rs 85 food cost aur Rs 18 delivery cost milake Rs 103 per meal hai; agar aap 8% equity ke liye Rs 40 lakh maang rahe ho to yeh Rs 5 crore valuation bilkul unsustainable lagta hai kyunki aapke paas koi quality audit ya compliance trail nahi hai in teen home kitchens mein. Worst day par agar inme se ek kitchen band ho gaya ya aapka single supplier aata-sabzi de nahi paya, toh aapka entire supply chain collapse kar jayega aur inventory unpaid pile up ho jayegi.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 6
}

{
  "message": "Aapka Rs 900 CAC payback 1.1 months hai, par yeh matlab nahi ki company defensible hai; yeh bas ek thin wrapper hai jiski switching cost bilkul zero hai kyunki koi bhi naya Pune IT park mein competitor easily replace kar sakta hai. Teen home kitchens par FSSAI registration ka koi moat nahi banata. I'm out because this is a services business disguised as SaaS with no scalable moat.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

{
  "message": "Aapka 1.1 months ka CAC payback sunne mein toh kamaal hai, par yeh sirf office WhatsApp groups se aaya hai aur Pune ke IT parks ke baahar yeh distribution ka jugaad fail ho jayega. Teen home kitchens mein FSSAI registration trust toh dikhata hai, par ek supplier ka failure ya ek kitchen band hone par poora supply chain collapse kar jayega, aur yeh risk Rs 5 crore ki valuation par bilkul fit nahi baithta. Isliye main pass kar rahi hoon.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

{
  "message": "180 subscribers in 5 months matlab roughly 36 naye bande har mahine aaye, aur 64% renewal ke hisaab se bas 115 log tikenge. Rs 900 CAC divided by (Rs 36 margin multiplied by 22 meals) equals 1.1 months payback, par yeh WhatsApp groups se aaya hai jo ek din band ho sakte hain. Pune IT parks ke baahar distribution ka koi plan nahi, aur 85 rupees food cost par teen home kitchens se Rs 5 crore valuation mangna bilkul pagalpan hai. I'm out because this is a cash-burn wrapper with no scalable moat and an impossible valuation.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

{
  "message": "Beta, 900 divided by (36 * 22) gives 1.1 months ka CAC payback, par yeh tab tak accha lagta hai jab tak aap month 3 ka actual churn rate nahi batate. 64% renewal month 2 mein hai, aur mere liye DabbaDost jaisa Pune ka tiffin feature tabhi company banta hai jab customer teesri baar bina discount ke order kare, jo aapke paas abhi missing hai, isliye main maybe par hoon 5/10 confidence.",
  "out": false,
  "stance": "maybe",
  "confidence": 5
}

{
  "message": "Aapka Rs 900 CAC payback 1.1 months hai, par yeh 88% renewal month 3 se shuru hone ke baad bhi ek saal tak Pune IT parks tak hi simatna ek bada red flag hai kyunki aapke paas unpaid inventory ya working capital ka koi buffer nahi hai agar koi ek home kitchen band ho gaya. Mere hisaab se 180 subscribers par Rs 5 crore ki valuation bilkul unjustified hai, isliye main pass kar rahi hoon.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

{
  "message": "Beta, 88% renewal month 3 se shuru hona sunke acha laga, par 12 months mein bas Pune tak simatna mujhe darata hai kyunki repeat purchase wale IT professionals agar ek baar city badal gaye toh yeh 36 rupees margin wala tiffin band kar denge. Mujhe Pune ke IT parks se bahar ka koi retention data nahi dikh raha, isliye main pass kar rahi hoon.",
  "out": true,
  "stance": "pass",
  "confidence": 9
}

